VisualizerModule -->\n\nSparqlNoResultsComponent->GraphVisualizerModule\n\n\n\n\n\nSparqlTableComponent\n\nSparqlTableComponent\n\nGraphVisualizerModule -->\n\nSparqlTableComponent->GraphVisualizerModule\n\n\n\n\n\nTriplesEditorComponent\n\nTriplesEditorComponent\n\nGraphVisualizerModule -->\n\nTriplesEditorComponent->GraphVisualizerModule\n\n\n\n\n\nUnsupportedTypeResultsComponent\n\nUnsupportedTypeResultsComponent\n\nGraphVisualizerModule -->\n\nUnsupportedTypeResultsComponent->GraphVisualizerModule\n\n\n\n\n\nGraphVisualizerComponent \n\nGraphVisualizerComponent \n\nGraphVisualizerComponent  -->\n\nGraphVisualizerModule->GraphVisualizerComponent \n\n\n\n\n\nSharedModule\n\nSharedModule\n\nGraphVisualizerModule -->\n\nSharedModule->GraphVisualizerModule\n\n\n\n\n\nGraphVisualizerService\n\nGraphVisualizerService\n\nGraphVisualizerModule -->\n\nGraphVisualizerService->GraphVisualizerModule\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    \n        Zoom in\n        Reset\n        Zoom out\n    \n\n\n\n\n\n    \n        Info\n    \n    \n        Source\n    \n\n\n\n    \n\n        \n            File\n        \n        \n            src/app/views/edition-view/edition-outlets/edition-complex/edition-detail/edition-graph/graph-visualizer/graph-visualizer.module.ts\n        \n\n\n\n        \n            Description\n        \n        \n            The GraphVisualizer module.\nIt embeds the graph visualizer components and pipes\nas well as the SharedModule.\n\n        \n\n\n        \n            \n                \n                    Declarations\n                    \n                        \n                            ConstructResultsComponent\n                        \n                        \n                            ForceGraphComponent\n                        \n                        \n                            GraphVisualizerComponent\n                        \n                        \n                            PrefixPipe\n                        \n                       